  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "两套入口",
      "items": [
        "BaseDetailActivity.transitionTo 供详情页按钮复用；SamplesRecyclerAdapter.startActivity 负责列表到详情",
        "两者都先经 TransitionHelper.createSafeTransitionParticipants，避免系统栏在动画中闪烁"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "动画来源",
      "items": [
        "程序化：TransitionActivity1 用 Fade，TransitionActivity2 用 Explode，TransitionActivity3 用 Slide(Gravity.RIGHT)",
        "XML：TransitionInflater.from(this).inflateTransition(R.transition.xxx)；返回时可由 finishAfterTransition 反向播放"
      ]
    }
  ]
